[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1561.669, "timestamp": "00:26:01", "text": "あなたにも似合っていますよ。 何？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1562.72, "timestamp": "00:26:02", "text": "何？ ジョック。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1567.412, "timestamp": "00:26:07", "author": "@SAMPAD0xd", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/z-ouOkiDmuLnDm7vYDgN15VrTbt3sZOYbPL2lTNTVk0bk60NZ3SuexCRYV5ICoE55YuyGhpt9w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/egJ1XufTKYfegwOo57ewAgUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/egJ1XufTKYfegwOo57ewAg"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1568.096, "timestamp": "00:26:08", "author": "@redx7454", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ZnCeavb1XjhCUyF0gPZf2zqHWkwDjnzleyD1oxpd-9re-emmqNet6n-8w_OiHe_rvcNpzZPLgw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/popcorn-yellow-striped-smile"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1575.75, "timestamp": "00:26:15", "text": "すばらしい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1577.99, "timestamp": "00:26:17", "text": "どうやって？ え、何？ 君は"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1583.405, "timestamp": "00:26:23", "author": "@SAMPAD0xd", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/z-ouOkiDmuLnDm7vYDgN15VrTbt3sZOYbPL2lTNTVk0bk60NZ3SuexCRYV5ICoE55YuyGhpt9w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "@Rocker_Shivansh"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1593.029, "timestamp": "00:26:33", "text": "いいえ、かっこいい鎧ではありません。 いいえ、違います。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1599.99, "timestamp": "00:26:39", "text": "あなたはそれが好き？ あなたはそれが好き？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1602.789, "timestamp": "00:26:42", "text": "大丈夫です。 それは良いです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1605.269, "timestamp": "00:26:45", "text": "見えますか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1608.149, "timestamp": "00:26:48", "text": "私はこれが欲しい。 彼はそれを使っているが、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1609.909, "timestamp": "00:26:49", "text": "もしよければ別のものを用意できるよ"}]